  "project_description": "This module prompts users to create redirects when content is deleted to help with both usability and SEO.\n\n The deleted content could have incoming links which would be broken without the redirect and search engine value assigned to the deleted content may be transfered to another page.\n\n The module suggests a default redirect which is the nearest parent for the deleted content. Nearest parent is determined by either menu or path elements.",
